  "title": "QUANTUM DIMENSIONS AND THEIR NON-ARCHIMEDEAN DEGENERATIONS",
  "authors_raw": "URI ONN AND JASPER V. STOKMAN",
  "title_lines": [
   "QUANTUM DIMENSIONS AND THEIR NON-ARCHIMEDEAN",
   "DEGENERATIONS"
  ],
  "abstract": "We derive explicit dimension formulas for irreducible MF-spherical KF-re- presentations where KF is the maximal compact subgroup of the general linear group GLd(F) over a local \ufb01eld F and MF is a closed subgroup of KF such that KF/MF re- alizes the Grassmannian of n-dimensional F-subspaces of Fd. We explore the fact that (KF,MF) is a Gelfand pair whose associated zonal spherical functions ident ify with vari- ous degenerations of the multivariable little q-Jacobi polynomials. As a result, we are led to consider generalized dimensions de\ufb01ned in terms of evaluations an d quadratic norms of multivariable little q-Jacobi polynomials, which interpolate between the various classi- cal dimensions. The generalized dimensions themselves are shown to have representation theoretic interpretations as the quantum dimensions of irreducible spherical quantum rep- resentations associated to quantum complex Grassmannians.",
